$ w --why 60 mph * 2h 15min

  ◆ interpretation
  │ 60 mph × (2 h + 15 min)

  ◆ result
  │ 135 mi

  ◆ other units
  │ 217.3 km  ·  237 600 yd  ·  217 261 m

  ◆ sources
  │ mph  Defined as mi/h (the mile: HB44 C-4)
  │ h    BIPM SI Brochure (9th ed., 2019), Table 8
  │ min  BIPM SI Brochure (9th ed., 2019), Table 8

  ──────────────────────────────────────────── W74
